  "prefLabel": "Puc 2106.03 Relation to Antitrust Laws",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2106.03 Relation to Antitrust Laws.\n\n(a) Nothing in this chapter shall be construed to confer immunity from state and federal antitrust laws.\n\n(b) A penalty assessed pursuant to Puc 2106.02 shall not affect or preempt antitrust liability but rather is in addition to any antitrust liability that might apply to the activity.\n\nSource. #7884-A, eff 5-2-03, EXPIRED: 5-2-11\n\nNew. #9921, eff 5-3-11; ss by #10909, eff 8-8-15; ss by #14556, eff 4-15-26, EXPIRES: 4-15-36 (formerly Puc 2106.07)\n\nAppendix\n\nRule(s) | State Statute (RSA)\n\nPuc 2100 | RSA 365:8, I(h); RSA 374-F:4; RSA 366\n\nPuc 2102.01 | RSA 366:1, II;\n\nPuc 2102.11 | RSA 366:1, II(a)\n\nPuc 2102.12 | RSA 362:2\n\nPuc 2102.13 | RSA 366:1\n\nPuc 2103 | RSA 378:10\n\nPuc 2104 | RSA 374-F:4, IX; RSA 378:10; RSA 363:38\n\nPuc 2105 | RSA 365:8, I (h); RSA 363:38; RSA 374:4\n\nPuc 2106 | RSA 365:40-44; RSA 365:8, I(h); and RSA 366:7",
